    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                "word": "unfazed",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "65f1fa78-cf30-4a86-bb6d-76964968e25b",
                        "entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more unfazed"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c5701d54-0618-4074-b81e-3b2960170fea",
                        "entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most unfazed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fcd07dda-c46a-3e69-9baf-ec7984e2c89b",
                        "entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not frightened or hesitant; undaunted; not put off; unimpressed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a4facf9-ab41-4df6-80c3-5b878a97e2fa",
                                "sense_id": "fcd07dda-c46a-3e69-9baf-ec7984e2c89b",
                                "text": "After stumbling and landing on her face, the toddler picked herself up and continued unfazed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63abf976-48b0-4ed7-b3a6-c51fddd45903",
                                "sense_id": "fcd07dda-c46a-3e69-9baf-ec7984e2c89b",
                                "text": "Say, but isn't Annie Watson a dandy witness? She testified as straight as a book. And she stood a hot cross-examination unphased."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd7d1ee2-c9b2-437b-9b76-251708ff6e29",
                                "sense_id": "fcd07dda-c46a-3e69-9baf-ec7984e2c89b",
                                "text": "The Johnnie O'Briens and the Barney O'Rourkes were there, too, apparently unfazed by the magnificence of the surroundings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0e482d2-41e7-4f5e-a95a-dbb725db16dc",
                                "sense_id": "fcd07dda-c46a-3e69-9baf-ec7984e2c89b",
                                "text": "When outsiders heard the melodies of Johann Sebastian Bach in a single-voice, monophonic square wave, no harmony, they were universally unfazed. Big deal!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3d24c69-9e95-48e6-9be2-336b9309e431",
                                "sense_id": "fcd07dda-c46a-3e69-9baf-ec7984e2c89b",
                                "text": "Stu couldn't believe I was so unfazed by the whole incident, though inwardly I resolved that I wouldn't let this bastard have the last laugh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "31be8775-5366-43ff-8f8c-6fea77ded3d0",
                                "sense_id": "fcd07dda-c46a-3e69-9baf-ec7984e2c89b",
                                "text": "Shark attacks are very rare, according to experts. The Rockaway Beach attack appeared to be the first confirmed shark bite in New York City waters in decades. While beachgoers seemed mostly unfazed, the encounter prompted city officials to deploy more drones, boats and helicopters to monitor the city’s beaches."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "74d791eb-bf59-3bff-b967-343a7a22f214",
                        "entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Undamaged."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6d12f46-6a31-4def-a5b1-174f2a3ba9a9",
                                "sense_id": "74d791eb-bf59-3bff-b967-343a7a22f214",
                                "text": "The tall man throughout was \"unphased\"—the dewy and least compact one surrendered!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "488c1440-286d-415d-8e80-26f24d5b0303",
                                "sense_id": "74d791eb-bf59-3bff-b967-343a7a22f214",
                                "text": "Being a lad of a little upwards of a century, and maintaining, as all widowers do, that I was unfazed by time […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "243c2c31-efe7-4dfd-8658-6d6231042b94",
                                "sense_id": "74d791eb-bf59-3bff-b967-343a7a22f214",
                                "text": "He next, while the flame continued to heat the chimney to the utmost, dashed upon it a dipper of water, and still the chimney was unfazed"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e420a36-51df-4586-8561-38a8109325a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                        "source_sense_description": "undaunted",
                        "target_lang_word": "impassible",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "impassible",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e5852db-bf78-3168-9293-a759f2aa63b4",
                                        "entry_id": "b13dd3d1-1bd0-3a96-98c1-9d52bf27464a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n’est pas susceptible de souffrance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f447ace-291b-4266-b2f1-0ca2d2cf6534",
                                                "sense_id": "6e5852db-bf78-3168-9293-a759f2aa63b4",
                                                "text": "Jean Valjean était entré au bagne sanglotant et frémissant ; il en sortit impassible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e0bf1c1-02da-49dd-8514-e819b446703a",
                                                "sense_id": "6e5852db-bf78-3168-9293-a759f2aa63b4",
                                                "text": "Pourquoi ce bœuf impassible, et qui ne rumine même pas, semble-t-il attendre, pour ne pas brouiller l’herbe française avec l’herbe allemande ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46961324-ccc3-38ae-bd20-ea6376caccf9",
                                        "entry_id": "b13dd3d1-1bd0-3a96-98c1-9d52bf27464a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est assez maître de lui pour ne pas laisser paraître ses souffrances physiques ou ses émotions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3110a061-1731-43d7-bb6e-5af20a320a28",
                                                "sense_id": "46961324-ccc3-38ae-bd20-ea6376caccf9",
                                                "text": "Le « Virtuosa » est un vaisseau clinquant, joyeux, coloré, kitch, digne représentant assumé du gigantisme et de tous les superlatifs, devant lequel il est difficile de rester impassible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fe29d1a-a56b-46c9-8e04-14fefd4d735e",
                                                "sense_id": "46961324-ccc3-38ae-bd20-ea6376caccf9",
                                                "text": "À ce moment, il remarqua que le Prince était réellement un quidam formidablement découplé et d’aspect suprêmement impassible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ec0d70f3-c00a-4eb7-9f36-2d8b433ab56a",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                        "source_sense_description": "undaunted",
                        "target_lang_word": "imperturbable",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imperturbable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                        "entry_id": "fc8fa9b7-baf0-3f71-91b6-6338331d3e16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que rien ne peut troubler, ébranler ou émouvoir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec7cc95e-27fe-4434-bc1a-8bc2317ae0ad",
                                                "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                                "text": "C'était un gros garçon, artiste peintre au moins médiocre, à vue très-courte, moralement s'entend, qui ne doutait de rien et parlait de tout avec un aplomb imperturbable. Il prétendait avoir une grande instruction; mais il est à croire qu’il l’avait reçue sous le sceau de la confession, car il ne révélait jamais rien. Emile Mathieu, L’esprit de famille, Paris : Librairie Hachette & Cie, 1863, p. 114"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df73e38e-5b74-436f-9311-aa82f2c2b06b",
                                                "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                                "text": "Le navire imperturbable cingle vers l'immensité polaire, se glisse parmi les icebergs fantastiques qui dérivent en tournoyant cauteleusement, évités de justesse, en vain menaçants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ddad356-5616-47fd-aa6c-c468f652c04b",
                                                "sense_id": "267392ca-c648-39a0-b3b6-1deb92b87ced",
                                                "text": "Les vrais amis sont comme les arbres\nIls ont hâte de te voir\nMais restent imperturbables\nSi tu ne passes pas dire bonsoir »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "feb4bc2f-b226-4ef6-abdf-dc7cf20babdc",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9310462-e5e8-3f73-b44f-3448fbba26e8",
                        "source_sense_description": "undaunted",
                        "target_lang_word": "unbeeindruckt",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unbeeindruckt",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f510b8b-fb3b-3031-b2e6-4bd351924465",
                                        "entry_id": "25abd428-17e3-3ff3-a362-a378566ea541",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "trotz äußerer Einflüsse keine starke (auch emotionale) Reaktion zeigend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7576b79f-1938-4c04-97b1-cdf3f05311af",
                                                "sense_id": "8f510b8b-fb3b-3031-b2e6-4bd351924465",
                                                "text": "„Harsche Kritik des Bundesrechnungshofs, der für das Monopolunternehmen bald dicke Verluste befürchtete, ließen Schwarz-Schilling und seine Kabinettskollegen ebenso unbeeindruckt wie der Vorwurf, daß die eigentlich zur Neutralität verpflichtete Bundespost damit massiv in die Medienpolitik eingriff, die ausschließlich – so will es die Verfassung – Sache der Bundesländer ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a750c748-1ef9-40d8-abcf-5e62596f150b",
                                                "sense_id": "8f510b8b-fb3b-3031-b2e6-4bd351924465",
                                                "text": "„Jetzt stand er da, über und über voller Kratzer und Erde, und wirkte sogar noch unbeeindruckter von ihrem Flehen als Lady Melora.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96b2d77e-ed5a-4c18-ab36-20a7a183f97b",
                                                "sense_id": "8f510b8b-fb3b-3031-b2e6-4bd351924465",
                                                "text": "„Die Protest-Routine auf Sachsens Straßen ist von all dem aktuell noch unbeeindruckt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da6cc0e8-1225-4815-92de-bd00f47ec4c7",
                                                "sense_id": "8f510b8b-fb3b-3031-b2e6-4bd351924465",
                                                "text": "„Schon bei einer Betriebsversammlung im vergangenen Herbst hätte sich der Geschäftsführer von Schildern mit Forderungen nach einem Tarifvertrag unbeeindruckt gezeigt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd7ea205-b2d3-4c63-84a1-118db5ef7e71",
                                                "sense_id": "8f510b8b-fb3b-3031-b2e6-4bd351924465",
                                                "text": "„Die Mannschaft zeigte sich von den finanziellen Schwierigkeiten weitestgehend unbeeindruckt, stand während der gesamten Saison 2017/18 nie schlechter als auf Rang 10 und beendete die Spielzeit auf dem vierten Tabellenplatz.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbd56ea9-9ecc-4dc1-9dfe-1170d0118fb9",
