            {
                "entry_id": "9f7153d0-e8fa-3ccb-b37d-c248690b781b",
                "word": "unfazed",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "44fd64c4-c43b-467b-af02-5ae9839707fb",
                        "entry_id": "9f7153d0-e8fa-3ccb-b37d-c248690b781b",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more unfazed"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "92a351d4-a171-4ee1-b5de-c6a986e79c7c",
                        "entry_id": "9f7153d0-e8fa-3ccb-b37d-c248690b781b",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most unfazed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b9a8ce4-3778-3c62-938d-20487025e3cd",
                        "entry_id": "9f7153d0-e8fa-3ccb-b37d-c248690b781b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "不害怕的，不犹豫的，不动摇的，不惧的，无畏的"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "604d2bb3-128d-493d-899e-4cf800fe46ce",
                                "sense_id": "9b9a8ce4-3778-3c62-938d-20487025e3cd",
                                "text": "Say, but isn't Annie Watson a dandy witness? She testified as straight as a book. And she stood a hot cross-examination unphased."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76d96af7-c495-4046-8b8b-08bc7be4fe6d",
                                "sense_id": "9b9a8ce4-3778-3c62-938d-20487025e3cd",
                                "text": "The Johnnie O'Briens and the Barney O'Rourkes were there, too, apparently unfazed by the magnificence of the surroundings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb9cec9a-99e3-4e5e-9527-e4499bf733c7",
                                "sense_id": "9b9a8ce4-3778-3c62-938d-20487025e3cd",
                                "text": "Stu couldn't believe I was so unfazed by the whole incident, though inwardly I resolved that I wouldn't let this bastard have the last laugh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90e636e2-3b48-476f-9e49-d4641509cc74",
                                "sense_id": "9b9a8ce4-3778-3c62-938d-20487025e3cd",
                                "text": "After stumbling and landing on her face, the toddler picked herself up and continued unfazed.",
                                "translation": "跌倒摔到脸上以后，幼童爬起来，没有迟疑继续走。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a985458d-c07a-3167-a2a8-a72649957015",
                        "entry_id": "9f7153d0-e8fa-3ccb-b37d-c248690b781b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(古舊) 毫发无损的"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a692d07-c787-4eb1-a9fd-20c740c4468d",
                                "sense_id": "a985458d-c07a-3167-a2a8-a72649957015",
                                "text": "The tall man throughout was \"unphased\" -- the dewy and least compact one surrendered!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eeed58a4-9baa-456e-a065-b4b13886f9c3",
                                "sense_id": "a985458d-c07a-3167-a2a8-a72649957015",
                                "text": "Being a lad of a little upwards of a century, and maintaining, as all widowers do, that I was unfazed by time ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1471337-cbf5-4e52-865e-8d2f680aa8e4",
                                "sense_id": "a985458d-c07a-3167-a2a8-a72649957015",
                                "text": "He next, while the flame continued to heat the chimney to the utmost, dashed upon it a dipper of water, and still the chimney was unfazed"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": [
